  <!-- Liquidity Security -->
  <section id="liquidity">
    <h2>Liquidity Security</h2>
    <p>Liquidity is permanently locked in the Clanker LP Locker contract. This ensures the token cannot be rug-pulled.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Liquidity Pool Address: <code>0x5116773e18a9c7bb03ebb961b38678e45e238923</code></li>
      <li>LP Locker Contract: <code>0x5ec4f99f342038c67a312a166ff56e6d70383d86</code></li>
      <li>LP NFT Token ID: <code>2246136</code> (Uniswap V3 Position Manager)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="info-card">
      <h3>Anti-Rug Proofs</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>The LP contract contains no <code>decreaseLiquidity</code>, <code>burn</code>, or <code>transferFrom</code> functions</li>
        <li>Only trading fees can be collected via Uniswap's official <code>collect()</code> function</li>
        <li>The LP NFT is permanently locked with no withdrawal or burn functions</li>
        <li>LP NFT can only be received from official Clanker Factory during deployment</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="https://basescan.org/tx/0x2cf2f8330f8e1b72c5efdc1db80790e6f47ff0c3af6a33cec31186f2c7df795e" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Lock Confirmation Transaction →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

